# Scenario name
msgid "utils_customElements"
msgstr "utils_customElements"

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"Wrapper upon different stations, so mission author can add button/"
"information to station Operator,\n"
"abstracting the position through which the operator fulfills his duties.\n"
"This module should remove multiple boilerplate to accomodate 6/5 and 4/3 "
"station categories.\n"
"Operator in context of this module means player fulfilling specific duties "
"aboard the ship\n"
"(for example Engineer can use \"Engineering\" or \"Engineering+\")."
msgstr "Wrapper upon different stations, so mission author can add button/information to station Operator,\nabstracting the position through which the operator fulfills his duties.\nThis module should remove multiple boilerplate to accomodate 6/5 and 4/3 station categories.\nOperator in context of this module means player fulfilling specific duties aboard the ship\n(for example Engineer can use \"Engineering\" or \"Engineering+\")."
